 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nOur website's safari packages are examples of the amazing trips available\n\nOur sales team are here to plan you tailor made holiday to Tanzania\n\nJohari Msangi - Travel Specialist \n \n\n+255784278205\n\nENQUIRE NOW\nBEST TIME TO GO\nJune-March\nTIME DIFFERENCE\nGMT + 3Hours\nFLIGHT DURATION\nFLY TO\nKilimanjaro Via Nairobi\nApprox 10hr\nTanzania Safari Packages\nSerengeti Escape\nA Romantic Adventure\n\nEmbark on a breathtaking five-day romantic safari with the \"Serengeti Escape: A Romantic Adventure.\" Designed for couples, this trip combines luxury, wildlife, and cultural experiences in Tanzania’s stunning landscapes.\n\n5 DAYS FROM $4090pp\n\nLuxury Savannah to Shore 9 Day Adventure\n\nFrom Savannah to Shore : A 9-Day Tanzanian safari and Zanzibar Retreat. Enjoy a wonderful safari adventure, visiting the breathtaking Serengeti, Ngorongoro Crater and Tarangire National Park. Then sit back and unwind on the luxury beaches of Zanzibar, with golden sands and crystal blue waters.\n\n9 DAYS FROM $5699pp\n\nSerengeti Under The Stars\n\nThis itinerary provides an immersive connection with nature. Lower budget camping offers a sustainable and authentic way to experience the wilderness, making safaris more accessible while fostering a deeper appreciation for wildlife conservation.\n\n7 DAYS FROM $2199pp\n\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\nFamily Wilderness Adventure 7-Day Safari \n\nEmbark on a 7-day family safari in Tanzania, exploring Arusha's lush landscapes, the iconic Serengeti, and tranquil Tarangire National Park. Tailored for families, this journey offers thrilling wildlife encounters, cultural experiences, and unforgettable adventures suitable for all ages.\n\n7 DAYS FROM $3300pp\n\nA Romantic Honeymoon Safari and Zanzibar Retreat\n\nEmbark on an enchanting 12-day honeymoon that combines a luxury safari across Tanzania's famed parks with a serene beach retreat in the exotic Zanzibar, creating the perfect blend of adventure and relaxation for newlyweds.\n\n12 DAYS FROM $8600pp\n\nWinged Wonders: 7 Days Tanzanian Birdwatching \n\nEmbark on a 7-day birdwatching adventure across Tanzania's vibrant ecosystems. From Arusha's lush landscapes to the vast Serengeti, discover a rich tapestry of avian life, perfect for both novice birders and seasoned ornithologists seeking the ultimate birding expedition.\n\n7 DAYS FROM $2800pp\n\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\n7-Day Great Migration river crossing Adventure \n\nEmbark on a thrilling safari! Witness the Great Migration and explore the Ngorongoro Crater, home to the famed Big 5. Enjoy luxury accommodations from July to October. Experience wildlife like never before!\n\n7 DAYS FROM $3799pp\n\nWildlife Photography Safari, Capture Every Moment\n\nJoin our 8-day Tanzania photo safari, featuring prime wildlife photography in Tarangire, Serengeti, and Ngorongoro. Capture stunning African wildlife and landscapes with our professional guides. Enjoy park-side accommodations for the perfect shot!\n\n8 DAYS FROM $3150pp\n\nWild Wonders: A Safari Across Serengeti, Tarangire, and Ruaha\n\n10 DAYS FROM $7500pp\n\nREAD MORE\nREAD MORE\n\nEmbark on a thrilling 10-day safari across Tanzania, exploring the Serengeti, Tarangire, and Ruaha National Park. Experience diverse ecosystems, encounter the Big Five, and enjoy breathtaking landscapes with expert guides on this unforgettable adventure.\n\nREAD MORE\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
